From: Cheng Rui <286040359@qq.com>
Date: Tue, 6 Oct 2026 10:58:11 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] [Perf][DSv4.1] Reuse SM90 sparse decoder from #59418

Adapt the decoder from luoyuctl's PR #59418 at
eddfa5ed50c16a632b8fae2e523ad54e504f3e0b as the shared dependency
for the independent native-head backend. Specialize the three page-size
parameters as tl.constexpr; otherwise keep the decoder unchanged.
Keep this shared contribution separate from backend integration and
query-pairing changes.

