Subject: [PATCH 2/2] [Perf][DSv4.1] Add independent SM90 native-head sparse
 backend

Address #57673 review with centralized opt-in selection and independent
Triton prefill/decode. Share exact sparse KV unions across eligible
verification-query pairs; preserve per-forward and CUDA Graph lifetimes.
Add startup warmup, correctness and compatibility coverage, H100 CI,
and backend usage documentation. Default backend selection is unchanged.

The paired decoder derives its KV loader and split softmax from #59418;
query-union prior art is #55372.

